  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-a9fcf0a6-beef-4dae-a0b0-a711f2e50f42\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8da4d9dc-8bfb-46e7-923d-461668edd551\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9fa4b10a-87bb-48f3-be6f-c4e0fe5ced15\">이번주 토요일은 수강생 분기별 모임이 있는 날입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2c8b15e0-0955-4f33-8fd1-77127a89ae05\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a77005d4-7a6e-4c16-bc6d-6701f14052a9\">오시는 분들은 아시겠지만 분기별 모임에서는 매번 특강을 합니다. 특강 내용은 당연히 제가 마케팅 대행을 하면서 느낀점 그리고 어떻게 하시면 좋을지 등에 대한 내용입니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f132acdb-6b74-463a-b8d9-8de65177d17b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ef48524f-63b9-40bb-8fde-7c18b02b43bf\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1090788e-d201-45b2-806a-3d4c2765e580\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-37422be2-2909-4084-ad25-2f08c3d133cd\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0de40726-3088-4e2d-95de-ee35c7237c20\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c7e51fca-eafa-4dca-8665-22271de61040\">지난번 모임때는 특강만 거의 3시간을 해버렸더라구요;;</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-a9fcf0a6-beef-4dae-a0b0-a711f2e50f42\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-84ac414f-a056-4b0b-ac55-91d7bf595004\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:689px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-84ac414f-a056-4b0b-ac55-91d7bf595004\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTA2MTZfMjk5/MDAxNzUwMDM4Nzg2NjA3.v8aqsStGg66LFLrYQdT9GCkh1QifVeyviXPScZ4Qdpgg.CUrx_kDY0hWogZKqpLIWsZUvoBk-9bWypp2yPLB5KUcg.PNG/SCR-20250616-jxux.png?type=w1600\", \"originalWidth\" : \"689\", \"originalHeight\" : \"329\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTA2MTZfMjk5/MDAxNzUwMDM4Nzg2NjA3.v8aqsStGg66LFLrYQdT9GCkh1QifVeyviXPScZ4Qdpgg.CUrx_kDY0hWogZKqpLIWsZUvoBk-9bWypp2yPLB5KUcg.PNG/SCR-20250616-jxux.png?type=w1600\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_image\", \"id\": \"SE-84ac414f-a056-4b0b-ac55-91d7bf595004\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"image\", \"ai\": \"false\" }}'></script>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-3085f86b-f58c-4e90-aa93-305fc6dcc7ad\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c90688ff-aee5-4266-8969-0f96551a16dc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-bd72ea0b-0199-47e3-a66b-d85a54fd45ff\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-16300035-32b1-4f97-9de0-14be55c21ee3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-427cca5c-f694-48e7-9679-93e3506c710a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0d41d7c0-be18-44d4-a4f9-c224f087b3d9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a567f857-6880-4c9c-948e-d5035da63057\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4351016f-a007-413d-8b38-3a594702893d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-83a67903-d6de-4364-80c6-fb885b006745\">사실 이번에는 할 이야기가 정말 많습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-94e97e1f-577c-4955-ad66-8e8ebe999925\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-cafe4235-373e-4543-97b0-19a7d1707e4e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0b4b00b9-8e12-44c1-ac9c-34c51c0b9442\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-758cb9a7-5177-45d0-ae61-9fae2375fe0f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-126274c7-9093-4089-aeb8-857461c2dda4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-3d62d20e-7850-4cb4-bdd6-e8b010306867\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-150adca9-89c4-432c-98e0-2403620175ce\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b8804312-393e-4b1b-ae22-7e008367588d\">정확히는 &#x27;제가 팔고 있는 마케팅 전략&#x27; 에 대한 이야기 입니다. 마케팅 대행은 &quot;블로그를 대신 써주는 것, 유튜브를 대신 해주는 것, 인스타를 대신 운영해주는 것&quot; 이런 서비스를 파는게 아닙니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ca2d0b61-b17e-4f5d-b92c-7d91c846cb20\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b040e20b-7354-40a3-8820-5f8b36c3d776\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2655452b-2662-4f38-a0e1-eb11c6efa060\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5e5ea142-2392-46f8-9cfb-2102d909dbb5\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-62908969-8300-424b-815e-a1f1ec75c803\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ba546c32-e797-45d7-997c-231345bb5ee9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a878f8d0-19b9-4690-ae34-d32811638330\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9c126d7a-af51-417b-b324-1f8761648a2a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-76bcb5ac-dcc6-4efb-8c56-9d9dbeb26bca\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a1039e1f-bd62-448d-ba97-867f8b75fdec\">마케팅 전략을 파는 것이죠.  마케팅 전략이란 이런 것입니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-3085f86b-f58c-4e90-aa93-305fc6dcc7ad\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-default\" id=\"SE-f94a3f14-beb9-4d66-ae07-cdc2a3d62f76\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-default\">\n                            <blockquote class=\"se-quotation-container\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text se-quote\"><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-24aeec04-a91b-4f2a-a4a7-243317e608f2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-98b5630a-8ac5-4e3a-9639-50db2725fedb\">어떤 </span><span style=\"color:#ff0010;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8f75a8f4-4c34-455a-b49c-269d1a7f0e55\">조건</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a50c649c-2fa5-45f2-80bd-eb5a4f7acf6b\">을 가진 업체에게 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-83d82acb-d39b-4658-8268-3e0e0fc8bb1d\"><span style=\"color:#ff0010;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-6f8e7c9a-9980-43a1-8874-849bf8f8ff0c\">이 방법</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-50bda97d-6a31-4736-a461-6791cdbd7335\">을 </span><span style=\"color:#ff0010;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b001facd-de36-45ce-a850-3e61638106bf\">이렇게</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f5caa908-8f3a-484f-bf77-da7241f1ecbf\"> 했을때 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-18d0e7a4-75a2-4e03-81d9-5981e2e6d4b7\"><span style=\"color:#ff0010;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ad0fb197-5d3a-407c-ba64-8001894fee33\">이정도 매출</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7b12ffaf-7e69-4d8c-b57d-6e948256dd76\"> 효과를 줄수 있다 </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --></div>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-e2b0b558-0db8-4c9a-8d43-259d95f09ff8\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-33af6e7e-4933-473a-9b8f-e5aaa7ec01ee\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-863fac0d-409d-49f8-a5c8-6ee99f8c8923\">여기서 어느 정도 매출을 올려주느냐에 따라 받을 수 있는 금액이 달라지는 거구요. 당연히 그 매출 금액은 방법이 다양할수록, 또 각 방법을 어떻게 하느냐에 따라 커질수 있습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1f890a1d-33c6-4b68-bcab-c82131f29d1e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-97a256be-4ae5-4e04-8cb3-b0f0cbaab160\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4092c649-9353-4904-acab-4116aff1a615\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-36cd1cb9-0ccf-49ec-a343-4acd0843d129\">그래서 가능한 다양한 방법을 각 업계에 맞게 어떻게 &#x27;조정&#x27;하느냐에 따라 올려줄 수 있는 매출이 달라지고, 그래서 내가 받는 돈이 달라지는 거죠. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f0192096-d358-489e-bf5b-094875b444c4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9e12cb55-a1f9-48a7-b45b-121f9b7fb106\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-aa5a8bc4-9c42-4dc7-b1a8-4e31e1c076c1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d5f55d7d-6193-4133-b074-ffa3b1a1c1cd\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f3f4b49a-d935-4819-bb38-213efcef75d5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8946d328-a042-4394-981b-e18aa1006e5f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-518425fc-4e8b-41fe-a0a9-7b2157d0618f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-de7593c1-c833-404f-bc8e-03a988f83584\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a9e91ed1-5466-4617-ade3-53d004039ea3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9bd614fd-12f3-4d6e-8527-dc543dba19c8\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d88b7f33-4775-4b74-bed8-adf612981443\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7f7c3bf8-c983-4186-8e86-6c880865d2c9\">제 블로그 강의에 소개되어있는건 여러 방법중 초보자분이 가장 하기 쉬운 한가지가 소개되어있는 것입니다. 정확히는  5인이하 / 고관여 / 지역기반 이런 조건을 가진 업체들에게 &#x27;블로그&#x27; 라는 방법으로 매출을 올려주는 방법 하나를 배우는거죠. 이게 가장 기본이거든요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-44e83682-494d-43c4-ade0-6240fb609003\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e5f54a10-ea3f-444f-9455-98637f596bc6\"> </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-37c597a6-ebcd-4788-a864-fe091970b8ee\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-038f72db-5dec-4f1f-b918-68ce2907e7fd\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c925eff4-5ebd-483e-a9da-de8ef1410364\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-0a91cff2-b9d2-4dd2-8339-ba5ffc5f1c96\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6eb896c2-a3b2-49c1-a44c-6daf18ae6075\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b954732b-02d8-4edd-856d-2451862b11f0\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3741979d-c433-40d5-a642-23d095d49961\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-de39b9d7-49d9-454a-b2d0-f42d7bce7d6d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d6f663be-fda5-489e-b400-bcbc1f8ef83d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-6e06465e-c240-4bc6-be9c-62b8542f2e10\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a0ce6a0f-6478-4dfd-9001-539dbcd8e778\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-fe413902-77f6-4f8c-a386-c871b04a9f0b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f40ca4d8-96a0-4170-a1b2-4bed26c38592\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-dc138a88-4345-46a0-8e5c-f005aa05d877\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b499f548-64d6-48e3-b04c-70a5abb566bf\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1e531324-b076-4fea-90e6-ef64d5db65dd\">이런거를 찾는 방법은 그냥 모든 업계를 하나하나 해보면서 저장해놓으면 됩니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-76c86066-88dc-49ad-9654-2bf54acd9c41\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e9aabf24-b995-4501-8915-c67fe037312a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e3394807-d039-4aa8-a4d6-0b6483c680df\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e4f95a1e-deb4-4a4e-ad36-612ab9191cae\">​</span></p><!-- } SE