  <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:270px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-9d23fe8b-6d62-417c-a68c-028bfc070e4c\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTA3MDFfMjMy/MDAxNzUxMzc2NjIxMjgz.om-3Zx-Cz3pzlIpbhF_IAzU4kHpKmsy1wmIf-2kU6mMg.hI7bNqqI3NzYlWHcu57m_4_IfwsSq9-qpbMAZxSEeVYg.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"270\", \"originalHeight\" : \"425\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNTA3MDFfMjMy/MDAxNzUxMzc2NjIxMjgz.om-3Zx-Cz3pzlIpbhF_IAzU4kHpKmsy1wmIf-2kU6mMg.hI7bNqqI3NzYlWHcu57m_4_IfwsSq9-qpbMAZxSEeVYg.PNG/image.png?type=w800\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_image\", \"id\": \"SE-9d23fe8b-6d62-417c-a68c-028bfc070e4c\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"image\", \"ai\": \"false\" }}'></script>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-8ee27024-fb2d-4e7a-aa6d-e2060f88c1f8\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-44fe5489-d60a-4e03-b923-d8e0c16b0939\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-59a72a41-6a4b-4ef8-b239-bb15ce3e68ba\"> </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5a4bc11e-8488-4ed4-935d-e0598c423989\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c8ca2950-ad72-4f44-a8e5-bb7790b3cd9c\">이런식으로 하는거죠. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-41574e12-7025-401e-9221-80792680419f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ded409cd-2d30-47ef-9fba-55c003167044\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6e0db55e-bc56-4f09-b009-240a51fc49b7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-dbad70de-c106-4c18-af56-631cf6aee82a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8c663ccd-d129-4e60-a857-3cd40dc64b77\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-40737934-4dd1-4de4-8c41-59726f3576f2\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a89a178b-4852-473b-9535-cbccc8299c56\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-07e1e367-3d14-4210-a451-12945554e766\">뭐 이런 이야기를 해보려고 합니다. 이번주 토요일에요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2d103dd8-8585-4e46-82fc-cdee4c4644d3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a769fe19-e17f-4af3-b262-68e5bb5c5fa3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-79376859-577d-4f5e-b229-bec8c9144627\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-002dc9ee-774b-458d-8d78-fa99db8f2b6c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-68ebfd59-a63f-4bd3-99ea-0647128e47dd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-59c4bbfe-dea6-4bc7-87a6-69d35bb60b0d\">그리고 이번 분기별모임때 오는 분들을 보니깐 이제 진짜 남을분들만 남았다는 생각이 듭니다. 제가 주는사란에서 강의한지가 이제 3년차에 접어들었는데 3년간 남아계신분들이 계신데 정말 제가 보답할 날이 얼마 남지 않았습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-42ea0936-53c9-429a-b33d-531e9a245344\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-60ce8c17-b90b-483f-a060-760c00bab645\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d3e6009e-64c6-430b-a977-002689af8b51\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1b20b057-bd93-4913-878b-e96a316c1e57\">그런 분들을 위해 아주 단단한 이야기 준비해가겠습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c1521c91-3b94-4fe1-8109-33fd60c50307\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-cf265174-cc02-40e7-a87d-d87d2af47542\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b90726ea-684d-475b-b49f-deab902e3581\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c8d19a78-5f4c-4d60-921c-0cb5c57f1bd3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-df3934f0-97a0-466f-98b9-e6e40cf59df6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-90cf7a92-3316-4575-b662-bdf5bfb7dcf6\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-70aad774-5cc9-49fd-8d5f-cb2de3d4f734\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e3cd3eb2-82f7-4cd3-ba9a-dcac1e40fe2a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2d11c47e-f020-4ef7-b0c1-237fb8838915\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-71cb2d0c-fb6d-40ae-a595-1bf59da8f95d\">아 그리고 마지막으로 하나 더 공지사항이 있습니다. 곧 인스타, 유튜브를 다 같이 배우는 마대창 ver3 가 오픈할 예정입니다. 아예 사무실와서 일하면서 배우는 그런 반입니다. 3인이하 소수반으로요. 이렇게 정말 다 할수 있는 분들을 찾고 있거든요! </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-19e065ee-ebbe-460c-846f-d3aa30a07310\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-5b521b00-bec1-45c7-bc35-e41886a633df\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a43b648c-615d-485f-83e3-109628092bfe\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-1f85fb3e-8d7d-4509-91db-50cc07896871\">그럼 토요일에 뵐게요!</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-8ee27024-fb2d-4e7a-aa6d-e2060f88c1f8\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>    </div>\n</div>\n",
